  "loanIdRule": "A loanId is an immutable opaque UUID assigned when an approved loan version first enters core data. It must not be a display name, spreadsheet row number, or runtime slug.",
  "sourceIdentityRule": "Raw source rows keep a separate sourceRowFingerprint and provenance record; source identity never replaces loanId."
